										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>the waves lift who i am today to shore</p>



<p>they never cease to amaze</p>



<p>sent from winds a far</p>



<p>my ancestors sailed these liquid desserts</p>



<p>they settled in places i may dream of tonight</p>



<p>my heart is carried back to early years</p>



<p>where golden lit afternoons held us all close</p>



<p>where time momementarily slowed for those of us</p>



<p>who were able to enjoy childhood</p>



<p>i dont see the future</p>



<p>i just see You, through the waves of time</p>



<p>through the Wind of your embrace</p>



<p>sail me near to you tonight</p>



<p>hold me near you</p>



<p>i&#8217;m here</p>



<p>-Jonathan McCallum 9th of Oct 2021</p>



